+/*
+ * FontCascade and Font without cairo (patch 0083), for gfopenfont.library:
+ * what FontCairo.cpp and FontCairoHarfbuzzNG.cpp gave. Glyph runs are
+ * drawn by GraphicsContextOpenGPU itself (drawGlyphs and
+ * drawGlyphsImmediate, 0082's OF_DrawGlyphsA); FontCascade::drawGlyphs is
+ * reached only from contexts that draw no pixels. Outlines, bounds and
+ * advances come from the face (OpenFontFace), at the font's size.
+ * The combining-sequence and emoji choice is FontCairoHarfbuzzNG.cpp's.
+ * MIT, Copyright (c) 2026 AmiCradle Team.
+ * SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
+ */
